---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { business, LAST_UPDATED, formatDate } from '../data/business';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Utah Heritage HVAC"
  description="How Utah Heritage HVAC collects, uses and protects the information you share through our website, forms, calls and text messages in Southern Utah."
  crumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy-policy/' }]}
>
  <section class="section bg-white">
    <div class="wrap prose-uh">
      <h1>Privacy Policy for Utah Heritage HVAC</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: {formatDate(LAST_UPDATED)}. [CLIENT TO PROVIDE: have this policy reviewed by your attorney before launch.]</em></p>
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>{business.name} ("we," "us") is a locally owned heating and air conditioning company serving Southern Utah. You can reach us at {business.phone} or {business.email}.</p>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Information you give us on forms or by phone: name, phone number, email, city, service details and messages.</li>
        <li>Basic website usage data collected by analytics tools, such as pages viewed, device type and approximate location.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your request, schedule service and send estimates and invoices.</li>
        <li>To contact you by call, text or email about your request, as you agreed when submitting the form.</li>
        <li>If you opt in, to send seasonal specials and maintenance reminders. You can opt out at any time.</li>
        <li>To understand how the website is used so we can improve it.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Text messages</h2>
      <p>If you agree to receive texts, message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help. We do not sell or share your mobile number or text messaging consent with third parties for their marketing.</p>
      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with service providers that help us run the business (for example, our scheduling, CRM and analytics tools), and when required by law.</p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics to measure website traffic. You can block cookies in your browser settings or use Google's opt-out browser add-on.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to update or delete your information by calling {business.phone} or emailing {business.email}.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows the latest version.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
